### 普通文本调用
POST {{$dotenv AI_BASE_URL}}/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv AI_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"{{$dotenv AI_MODEL}}","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"用一句话说明岗位匹配分析的目标"}]}

### 结构化输出探测（服务是否真正遵守 JSON 需实测）
POST {{$dotenv AI_BASE_URL}}/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv AI_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"{{$dotenv AI_MODEL}}","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"只输出 JSON：{\"matchScore\":0,\"evidence\":[]}"}],"response_format":{"type":"json_object"}}

### Tool Calling 探测（工具无副作用）
POST {{$dotenv AI_BASE_URL}}/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv AI_API_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"{{$dotenv AI_MODEL}}","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"为 Spring Boot 制定一个准备任务"}],"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"draft_preparation_task","description":"仅返回待确认的任务草案，不执行写入","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"title":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"type":"string"}},"required":["title","reason"]}}}]}
